  "title": "Auditory Naming EC",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings from 121 individuals performing an auditory naming task. Electrode coordinates are provided in MNI-305 (FreeSurfer fsaverage) space, and events mark stimulus onset, stimulus offset and response onset. The data were used to build a whole-brain millisecond-scale effective connectivity atlas of speech.",
  "methods_description": "Patients performed an auditory naming task during intracranial EEG recording, saved as EDF files. Events are coded as 401 (stimulus onset), 402 (stimulus offset) and 501 (response onset). Electrode coordinates are in MNI-305/fsaverage space in millimeters. Channels.tsv files list the data-header channels, including bipolar derivations.",
